  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      172.05,
      203.57,
      391.77,
      214.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE RIDHWANIYYAH ARABIC COLLEGE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.61,
      401.88,
      305.99
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a college known as \u201cRidhwaniyyah ArabicCollege\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka at No. 84,Kew Road, Colombo - 02 for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said college, according to the rulesagreed to by the Board of Management of the College:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      320.57,
      401.91,
      370.91
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said college has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant such application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      385.61,
      401.89,
      409.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.61,
      401.85,
      448.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Ridhwaniyyah ArabicCollege (Incorporation) Act, No. 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      463.61,
      401.93,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theRidhwaniyyah Arabic College (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCollege\u201d) and shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession under the name and style of \u201ctheRidhwaniyyah Arabic College\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued inall courts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      606.53,
      401.87,
      630.95
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      645.53,
      401.89,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "(a)to produce Islamic Theologists to lead thecommunity under the Islamic law of \u201cShariaa\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      608.11,
      455.14,
      636.38
    ],
