      305.69,
      397.18,
      328.55
    ],
    "text": "(e)to promote the policies of \u201cSunnath Wal Jamaath\u201dwithin the Islamic community;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      340.25,
      397.16,
      362.99
    ],
    "text": "(f)Learning and Teaching Islam in Arabic Languageaccording to Al Quran and AL Hadhees;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      373.25,
      397.19,
      395.99
    ],
