    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      406.25,
      397.17,
      463.55
    ],
    "text": "(h)Providing opportunity to students study Islam basedon the syllabus approved by the Ministry ofEducation and guiding the students to G.C.E.Ordinary Level and G.C.E. Advanced LevelExaminations;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      473.69,
      397.19,
      508.07
    ],
    "text": "(i)Organizing and Conducting a separate unit for theSocial Welfare, Economic Development andEducational Improvement of Muslim Ladies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      518.21,
      397.19,
      575.51
    ],
    "text": "(j)to promote and foster the policies of the \u201cSunnathWal Jamaath\u201d based on holy propagation of\u201cThableekh\u201d with the \u201cFikh\u201d (concepts of theSchool of Thought) laws of the \u201cShafiee Madhhab\u201dand the belief in \u201cAl Ashariya\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      585.65,
      397.17,
      620.03
    ],
    "text": "(k)to do all such acts and things as are in the opinionof the Corporation connected to any of the aboveand beneficial to the growth of the College.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      632.45,
      397.2,
      669.23
    ],
