    ],
    "text": "of fifteen members elected in accordance with the rules ofthe Corporation from among persons who shall be leaders inthe community and theologians, including the President,two Vice Presidents, two Joint Secretaries, the Treasurer, theAssistant Treasurer and Eight Committee Members. One ofthe Joint Secretaries shall be a teacher in the College.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      292.25,
      401.91,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Management of the Corporationshall be Board of Management of the College holding officeon the day preceding the date of commencement of this Actand which shall hold office until a new Board of Managementis elected in accordance with the rules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      368.45,
      401.86,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "(3) The office bearers of the Corporation shall hold officefor a term of one year and be eligible for re-election.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      406.61,
      313.44,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "5.A committee member shall:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
